{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras/566848c3c9fb63f98a318bd6afe39d82.avif?t=1773872753\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508430/extras_big/566848c3c9fb63f98a318bd6afe39d82.avif?t=1773872753 width=800 height=513 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>BlueLine</strong>&quot; is a visual narrative experience about the weight of expectation. <br><br><strong>Blue</strong>, a recent graduate who failed a job search, must fulfill the expectations of his family and girlfriend while trying to find happiness in life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a rich and introspective story, experiencing many heartbreaking scenarios, elevated by charming hand-drawn characters, beautiful scenery, and an award-winning original score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Rich Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Blue's downward spiral in his desperate pursuit to fulfill everyone's expectations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complex Characters &amp; Relationship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have thought-provoking interactions with characters who have\u00a0varied values, pulling Blue in different directions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Striking Visual &amp; Cinematic Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn animatic scenes\u00a0bring emotional moments to life and to enhance mood and storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive original music score that emphasized cinematic feel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Authentic Thai Setting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore\u00a0Thailand\u2019s culture, landscapes, and daily life\u00a0through Blue\u2019s eyes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508430?t=1773872753","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati